 (composer.json has no scripts section), so the fast and full gates could not be run as described."},{"file":"tests/bootstrap.php","problem":"The API token in the local bootstrap is not valid in the local database, so REST calls ran as the anonymous user and about 280 REST/SOAP tests failed. Nothing documents that a web server must run on 127.0.0.1:8989 or how to refresh the token. I started 'php -S 127.0.0.1:8989', created a token in the local DB (name BenchPHPUnit-*, it is still there) and used a temporary --bootstrap copy, without editing the repo file."},{"file":"tests/rest/RestIssueTest.php","problem":"The test sets tag_create_threshold to NOBODY and resets it only after an assertion. When the REST server is down, the assertion fails, the setting stays in the database, and later TagApiTest stops the whole PHPUnit run with 'Access Denied.' (exit). I deleted the leftover config row in the local DB. The test should restore the setting in a finally block or tearDown, and config_set() does not return the old value, so the reset value is also wrong."},{"file":null,"problem":"No test helper exists to build uploaded-file arrays or to count attachments without the bug_get_attachments() cache, so the new test queries the bug_file and bugnote tables directly."}]},"ttft_ms":1425,"type":"result","duration_ms":407191,"uuid":"cc5bc85b-b94d-4b0b-bec3-448d4d38af2b","ttft_stream_ms":1274,"time_to_request_ms":146,"first_content_frame_ms":1274,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":94,"outputTokens":32080,"cacheReadInputTokens":3440289,"cacheCreationInputTokens":87466,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":2.0297617999999997,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":7373,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":87466,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}}}
